*HEADING
Automotive Helical Crown Gear & Differential Carrier Assembly with Weld Flaw
Abaqus/Standard Dynamic Torque Rolling with DLOAD (Z-axis Rotation)
Units: mm, s, tonne, N, MPa (N/mm2), N.mm
Author: Victor Maia (vhfm08@gmail.com)
**
** ==================================================================
** 1. MESH & MATERIAL LIBRARY INCLUDES
** ==================================================================
*INCLUDE, INPUT=Materials_Assembly.inp
*INCLUDE, INPUT=Gear_Shaft_geometry.inp
*INCLUDE, INPUT=Gear_Shaft_bearing_sets.inp
**
** ==================================================================
** 2. MULTI-ZONE TIE DEFINITIONS
** Tie 1: toothed rim (C3D10) to the structured ring (C3D20) of the crown gear
** Tie 2: carrier body (C3D10) to the structured ring (C3D20) of the differential carrier
** ==================================================================
*TIE, NAME=TIE_CROWN, TYPE=SURFACE TO SURFACE
TIE_CROWN_TOOTH, TIE_CROWN_DIAMETER
**
*TIE, NAME=TIE_DIFF, TYPE=SURFACE TO SURFACE
TIE_DIFF_VOLUME, TIE_DIFF_DIAMETER
**
** ==================================================================
** 3. INTERFACE CONTACT DEFINITIONS
** Contact 1: sound laser weld over 252 deg (bonded, no separation)
** Contact 2: frictional contact over 360 deg; it carries the load across the unbonded
**            weld flaw (108 deg, theta = 36 to 144 deg, 30% of the circumference)
** ==================================================================
*SURFACE INTERACTION, NAME=INTER_WELDED
*SURFACE BEHAVIOR, NO SEPARATION, PRESSURE-OVERCLOSURE=HARD
*FRICTION, ROUGH
**
*SURFACE INTERACTION, NAME=INTER_DEFECT
*SURFACE BEHAVIOR, PENALTY
*FRICTION
0.20
**
*CONTACT PAIR, INTERACTION=INTER_WELDED, TYPE=SURFACE TO SURFACE, SMALL SLIDING, ADJUST=0.05
CONTACT_DIFF_WELD, CONTACT_CROWN_WELD
**
*CONTACT PAIR, INTERACTION=INTER_DEFECT, TYPE=SURFACE TO SURFACE, SMALL SLIDING, ADJUST=0.05
CONTACT_DIFF_PENALTY, CONTACT_CROWN_PENALTY
**
** ==================================================================
** 4. CARRIER SHAFT BEARING SUPPORT (KINEMATIC COUPLING + BOUNDARY CONDITION)
** Reference node RP_BEARING on the wheel axis (X = 0, Y = 0, Z = 0)
** Coupling 1: radial and tangential support of the carrier shaft (DOFs 1 and 2)
** Coupling 2: nodes shared by both supports (DOFs 1, 2 and 3)
** Coupling 3: axial shoulder of the carrier (DOF 3)
** BC: reference node fully fixed -> RM3 = reaction torque about Z
** ==================================================================
*NODE, NSET=RP_BEARING
600001, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0
**
*SURFACE, TYPE=NODE, NAME=BEARING_SURF_XY
BEARING_NODES_XY, 1.0
*SURFACE, TYPE=NODE, NAME=BEARING_SURF_XYZ
BEARING_NODES_XYZ, 1.0
*SURFACE, TYPE=NODE, NAME=BEARING_SURF_Z
BEARING_NODES_Z, 1.0
**
*COUPLING, CONSTRAINT NAME=COUPLING_BEARING_XY, REF NODE=RP_BEARING, SURFACE=BEARING_SURF_XY
*KINEMATIC
1, 2
*COUPLING, CONSTRAINT NAME=COUPLING_BEARING_XYZ, REF NODE=RP_BEARING, SURFACE=BEARING_SURF_XYZ
*KINEMATIC
1, 3
*COUPLING, CONSTRAINT NAME=COUPLING_BEARING_Z, REF NODE=RP_BEARING, SURFACE=BEARING_SURF_Z
*KINEMATIC
3, 3
**
*BOUNDARY
RP_BEARING, 1, 6, 0.0
**
** ==================================================================
** 5. DYNAMIC TORQUE ROLLING STEP VIA DLOAD USER SUBROUTINE
** Total time: 1.20 s (0.20 s stationary ramp + 1.00 s rolling across all 60 teeth)
** Transmits 270 N.m through tooth flanks (SURF_TOOTH) -> weld interface -> carrier
** ==================================================================
*STEP, NAME=GEAR_TORQUE_ROLLING, NLGEOM=NO, INC=1000
*STATIC
0.004, 1.20, 1.0E-05, 0.004
*DSLOAD
SURF_TOOTH, PNU
*OUTPUT, FIELD, FREQUENCY=10
*NODE OUTPUT
U
*ELEMENT OUTPUT
S, PEEQ
*CONTACT OUTPUT
CDISP, CSTRESS
**
** Bearing reaction at RP_BEARING every increment (RM3 = reaction torque, N.mm)
*OUTPUT, HISTORY, FREQUENCY=1
*NODE OUTPUT, NSET=RP_BEARING
RF1, RF2, RF3, RM1, RM2, RM3
*NODE PRINT, NSET=RP_BEARING, FREQUENCY=1
RF1, RF2, RF3, RM1, RM2, RM3
*END STEP
